SUMMARY:Tower Of Power: Holidays & Hits
LOCATION:Cerritos Center for the Performing Arts\, Cerritos
DESCRIPTION:For 58 years\, Tower of Power has delivered the best in Funk an
 
d Soul. Formed in Oakland in 1968\, the band defined its sound on East Bay 
 
Grease and signed to Warner Brothers\, turning out hits like You're Still A
 
 Young Man\, Down to The Nightclub\, So Very Hard to Go\, and What Is Hip? 
 
Five decades and a world of stages later\, those window-rattling grooves an
 
d that raucous party spirit still hit just as hard. Get ready for a night o
 
f Oakland Soul! Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/tower-of-power
 
